    "detailed_description": "Upirja is a first-person horror adventure set in the late 19th century in the Balkans. A murky evil distresses the lives of the villagers of a remote region surrounded by snowy mountains. Your mission, as inspector of the King, is to rid these lands from the ghoul that haunts them.<br><br><u>Features:</u><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Smooth low poly cartoon style graphic, musical elements of traditional Balkan songs, for a deep immersion in the tale.<br></li><li>Main game: six-chapter horror adventure, story inspired by ancient slavic folk legends. Follow the yarn to discover the darkness behind the curse of the Upirs.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Four extra games included!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The first one: hunt wolves in a lonely valley, but beware of the giant daemonic red wolf!<br></li><li>The second one: collect in the forest enough wood logs for the winter before the ghoul finds you.<br></li><li>The third one: defeat the horde of vampires emerging from their graves by swinging your axe.<br></li><li>... and the last one: you will be the Vampire, looking for revenge! Kill all the villagers and drink some tasty blood!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Upirja is a first-person horror adventure set in the late 19th century in the Balkans. A murky evil distresses the lives of the villagers of a remote region surrounded by snowy mountains. Your mission, as inspector of the King, is to rid these lands from the ghoul that haunts them.<br><br><u>Features:</u><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Smooth low poly cartoon style graphic, musical elements of traditional Balkan songs, for a deep immersion in the tale.<br></li><li>Main game: six-chapter horror adventure, story inspired by ancient slavic folk legends. Follow the yarn to discover the darkness behind the curse of the Upirs.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Four extra games included!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The first one: hunt wolves in a lonely valley, but beware of the giant daemonic red wolf!<br></li><li>The second one: collect in the forest enough wood logs for the winter before the ghoul finds you.<br></li><li>The third one: defeat the horde of vampires emerging from their graves by swinging your axe.<br></li><li>... and the last one: you will be the Vampire, looking for revenge! Kill all the villagers and drink some tasty blood!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Upirja is a first-person horror adventure game set in 19th Century in the Balkans. Find clues, fight the wolves and rid these lands of an evil ghoul that haunts them. Be a woodcutter lost in the forest, be a hunter against packs of wolves, fight hordes of revenants and... be the murky vampire!",
